    "principle": "Timing, spacing and holds",
    "standout": "Unevenly spaced light positions and brief pauses suggest insects hovering, darting and resting.",
    "scene": "A whimsical miniature forest of violet spiral trunks and warm-white branching contour shrubs, golden original firefly light sprites at a series of grounded slim pole positions. One bright hovering firefly, other waypoint orbs barely visible. Four bottom storyboard frames show firefly holding low, moving slightly, making a larger dart and holding higher. Discrete lit positions with clear difference in travel spacing, no motion blur or physical flying robot.",
